        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVIL PONGON GAME</strong> is a high-speed 2D platformer that blends precision movement with bullet-hell boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORE GAMEPLAY</strong> You play as Pongon, navigating treacherous platforming gauntlets inspired by Super Meat Boy's tight controls and Pizza Tower's momentum-based movement. Master wall-jumping, dashing, and advanced mobility techniques to speedrun through increasingly challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Also look how awesome and cool my steam page is wow)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE MECHANICS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Timer of Doom</strong>: Reach the hourglass at each level's end to trigger a countdown. When it hits zero, ENPHOSO materializes, a relentless entity that phases through walls and pursues you. Escape back to the start before contact means game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Combat Systems</strong>: Standard levels use traditional platforming, while boss encounters shift to Undertale-style bullet-hell battles where you dodge attacks in a confined arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-Reward Economy</strong>: Enphosolings (Enemy) don't deal damage, they take 50 riches per hit. Collect riches throughout levels to unlock customization options and upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable controls (default: WASD, Arrow Keys, Space, Shift, E, F)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning-focused level design with built-in timer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple movement abilities that chain together for advanced techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights with unique attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-5 hours of content in Early Access (expandable with speedrun optimization)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CURRENT EARLY ACCESS CONTENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ platforming levels across 3 distinct zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 major boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode for perfecting difficult sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endurance Mode for endless laps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization for your player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-floors for more content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade to try older Pongon Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hall of Fame to show off community work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extras area to show off concept art, old sprites and levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rewards mastery, what takes hours on your first attempt can be conquered in minutes once you've learned the optimal routes and movement techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLEASE NOTE: I AM ONE PERSON, THIS GAME IS NOT GOING TO RUN WITHOUT BUGS, I DO NOT HAVE THE MONEY TO TEST ON EVERY DEVICE AND GPU, IF YOU FIND AN ISSUE PLEASE JOIN OUR DISCORD AND REPORT IT.</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVIL PONGON GAME</strong> is a high-speed 2D platformer that blends precision movement with bullet-hell boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORE GAMEPLAY</strong> You play as Pongon, navigating treacherous platforming gauntlets inspired by Super Meat Boy's tight controls and Pizza Tower's momentum-based movement. Master wall-jumping, dashing, and advanced mobility techniques to speedrun through increasingly challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Also look how awesome and cool my steam page is wow)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE MECHANICS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Timer of Doom</strong>: Reach the hourglass at each level's end to trigger a countdown. When it hits zero, ENPHOSO materializes, a relentless entity that phases through walls and pursues you. Escape back to the start before contact means game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Combat Systems</strong>: Standard levels use traditional platforming, while boss encounters shift to Undertale-style bullet-hell battles where you dodge attacks in a confined arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-Reward Economy</strong>: Enphosolings (Enemy) don't deal damage, they take 50 riches per hit. Collect riches throughout levels to unlock customization options and upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable controls (default: WASD, Arrow Keys, Space, Shift, E, F)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning-focused level design with built-in timer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple movement abilities that chain together for advanced techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights with unique attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-5 hours of content in Early Access (expandable with speedrun optimization)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CURRENT EARLY ACCESS CONTENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ platforming levels across 3 distinct zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 major boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode for perfecting difficult sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endurance Mode for endless laps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization for your player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-floors for more content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade to try older Pongon Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hall of Fame to show off community work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extras area to show off concept art, old sprites and levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rewards mastery, what takes hours on your first attempt can be conquered in minutes once you've learned the optimal routes and movement techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLEASE NOTE: I AM ONE PERSON, THIS GAME IS NOT GOING TO RUN WITHOUT BUGS, I DO NOT HAVE THE MONEY TO TEST ON EVERY DEVICE AND GPU, IF YOU FIND AN ISSUE PLEASE JOIN OUR DISCORD AND REPORT IT.</h2>",
